cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Q-Matrix CBSE Curriculum Knowledge Graph Dataset"
abstract: >-
  A concept-and-skill knowledge graph derived from the CBSE curriculum, covering
  Maths (grades 1-10), Science (grades 6-10), and Environmental Science
  (grades 3-5). The dataset ships 223 per-chapter confirmed_curriculum.csv files
  as the canonical layer, plus an exported graph of 3,769 concept nodes and 7,448
  prerequisite edges across three levels: same-chapter, cross-chapter, and
  prior-grade. Produced by the Q-Matrix multi-agent pipeline with a human in the
  loop on escalation.
authors:
  - family-names: Tamboli
    given-names: Shrideep
    email: shrideep@prosoftpeople.com
    affiliation: Intelliana
repository-code: "https://github.com/MaximusTitan/q-matrix-dataset"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
version: 1.0.0
keywords:
  - curriculum-mapping
  - knowledge-graph
  - prerequisite-relations
  - education-technology
  - q-matrix
  - cbse

